  "description": "Why We Love It\nGone are the days when you need to choose a bike based on whether you want to go fast uphill or fast downhill. The Pique SX now slackens the head angle with its 140 mm fork option. With the new, more relaxed frame geometry and extra travel up front, you’ll feel confident to rip down hills and tackle climbs with equal gusto. Agile, light and capable, the Pique SX will have you negotiating rocky, rooty sections, uphill ledges and downhill drops with ease.\n\nBoost 15x110 [F], 12X148 [R] hub spacing improves stiffness, trail handling and tire clearance\n\n140 mm front suspension fork and 120 mm trunnion-mount Maestro Suspension offers enhanced suspension performance\n\nUpdated frame geometry for more downhill capability\n\nLightweight and highly durable in-house manufactured ALUXX-SL frame\n\nOverDrive steerer for precise steering, stiffness and control\n\nAdvanced Forged Composite Technology is used to create a lightweight composite upper rocker arm that achieves impressive lateral stiffness and strength\n\nDesigned using Liv’s 3F Design Philosophy to build bikes for women\n\n27.5-in wheel size optimizes traction and efficiency\n\nLivRight Sizing Philosophy for the perfect fit across all sizes",
